        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    claim_amounts = [150000]\n    claim_paid_dates = [\"year_end\"]\n    claim_settlement_expenses = [30000]\n    reinsurance_paid_claims = [70000]\n    reinsurance_paid_expenses = [10000]\n    discount_rate = 0.05\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    net_claim_liability = claim_amounts[0] - reinsurance_paid_claims[0]\n    net_expense_liability = (\n        claim_settlement_expenses[0] - reinsurance_paid_expenses[0]\n    )\n    total_net_liability = net_claim_liability + net_expense_liability\n\n    ibnr_reserve = total_net_liability / (1 + discount_rate)\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(ibnr_reserve)\n```",
